{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.16.0",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Wefty now opens on Today: what's due and late, tests coming up, flash cards to review, subscriptions renewing soon, and the notes you were just in. Tick things off right there.",
  "Four tabs: Today, Notes, Share and Chat. Share holds Send, Files and Clipboard together.",
  "Your picture at the top has Settings, Invite people, Feedback and Sign out. A small dot on it means something hasn't synced yet: tap it to see what.",
  "Tidier Settings: Account, Appearance, AI, Devices, Notes & files and About, each on its own page, with a search box. Type \"PIN\", \"dark\" or \"backup\" to find a setting.",
  "Subscriptions (Today's \u22ef menu): keep track of what you pay for and when it renews. Wefty reminds you on Today a few days before, and before a free trial ends.",
  "A new dark mode: deeper, softer and easier on the eyes, with Wefty's purple on each screen's main button. For phones with black screens there's Pure black too: Settings > Appearance.",
  "On a phone, Select notes is now in Notes' \u22ef menu (holding a note still picks it), and the search is behind the magnifier.",
  "Vault is now Wefty: same notes, same sign-in, a new name and icon. The web address is now crustyt0es.github.io/wefty/, and the old one sends you there."
 ],
 "build": "1.16.0-2935f629ae1d",
